# URL cua backend Spring Boot (chay tren may dev, port 8080).
# KHONG CAN DIEN BIEN NAY O DIEU KIEN BINH THUONG - src/api/client.js tu nhan dien IP may dang
# chay Expo (qua Constants.expoConfig.hostUri khi chay Expo Go/dev build, qua window.location
# khi chay web preview), nen doi mang Wi-Fi (nha/truong...) van tu dung, khong can sua gi.
# Chi dien gia tri o day khi muon ep TRO CUNG toi 1 backend co dinh (vd da trien khai that, hoac
# Android Emulator can http://10.0.2.2:8080 - dia chi dac biet tro ve localhost may dev).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.38:8080
